<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= title %></title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="login-shell">
  <div class="login-left">
    <div class="login-brand">
      <div class="lb">🛒</div>
      <div class="lt">
        <strong>TokoKita</strong>
        <small>E-Commerce Admin Panel</small>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="login-hero">
      <div class="illbox">
        <div class="cb-grid">
          <div class="cb"><span class="ic">📦</span><span class="lbl">JNE</span></div>
          <div class="cb"><span class="ic">📦</span><span class="lbl">J&amp;T</span></div>
          <div class="cb"><span class="ic">📦</span><span class="lbl">SiCepat</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>Kelola Toko Online Anda dengan Mudah &amp; Cepat</h2>
      <p>Platform admin terintegrasi dengan fitur multi-kurir tracking real-time. Pantau pesanan, pengiriman, dan pembayaran dalam satu dashboard.</p>
      <div class="feature-row">
        <span class="feat"><span class="chk">✓</span> Real-time tracking</span>
        <span class="feat"><span class="chk">✓</span> Multi-kurir support</span>
        <span class="feat"><span class="chk">✓</span> Laporan lengkap</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="login-footer">© 2026 TokoKita. All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="login-right">
    <div class="login-form-wrap">
      <h1>Selamat Datang Kembali! 👋</h1>
      <p>Masuk ke akun admin Anda untuk mengelola TokoKita.</p>

      <% if (flash.success && flash.success.length) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-success"><%= flash.success[0] %></div>
      <% } %>
      <% if (flash.error && flash.error.length) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-error"><%= flash.error[0] %></div>
      <% } %>

      <form method="POST" action="/login">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Email</label>
          <div class="input-with-icon">
            <input class="form-control" type="email" name="email" placeholder="admin@tokokita.com" required value="admin@tokokita.com" autofocus>
            <span class="icon">✉️</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label>Password</label>
          <div class="input-with-icon">
            <input class="form-control" type="password" name="password" id="password" placeholder="••••••••••" required>
            <span class="icon" style="cursor:pointer" onclick="(()=>{const p=document.getElementById('password');p.type=p.type==='password'?'text':'password';})()">👁</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-actions">
          <label class="checkbox">
            <input type="checkbox" name="remember">
            <span>Ingat saya</span>
          </label>
          <a href="#" class="link">Lupa password?</a>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block" style="height: 56px;">
          Masuk ke Dashboard <span>→</span>
        </button>
      </form>

      <div class="divider">atau</div>

      <div class="text-muted" style="text-align: center;">
        Belum punya akun? <a href="#" class="link">Daftar Sekarang</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
